        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>1-1/2 Inch Pacific Chiseled Acrylic Door Pull, First Impressions PCF150ACHFALSEF</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-1/2 Inch Pacific Offset Door Pull is made from hand chiseled acrylic in the center with frosted acrylic ends. Its water-like appearance makes this door pull especially great as a shower door handle. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass, fiberglass, or metal doors. 48\" overall.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions PCF150ACHFALSEF Offset Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Chiseled Acrylic with Frosted Ends</li>\r\n<li>Mount Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 36\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—  it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-1/2 Inch Pacific Chiseled Acrylic Door Pull",
                "description": "The 1-1/2 Inch Pacific Offset Door Pull is made from hand chiseled acrylic. Its water-like appearance makes this door pull especially great as a shower door handle. But it can be used all over. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass, fiberglass, or metal doors.",
